    "notes": [
      {
        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for google-guest-agent",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for google-guest-agent fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-78659: golang.org/x/net/http2: HTTP/2 server memory exhaustion due to Trailer headers (bsc#1286994).\n- CVE-2026-78660: golang.org/x/net/http2: HTTP/2 transport accepts malformed framing-related headers (bsc#1287058).\n- CVE-2026-78663: golang.org/x/net/http2: double flow control refund on HTTP/2 server streams (bsc#1287137).\n- CVE-2026-78669: golang.org/x/net/http2: excessive CPU consumption from repeated initial window changes (bsc#1285283).\n- CVE-2026-97032: golang.org/x/net/http2: HTTP/2 server crash due to HPACK encoder race (bsc#1287487).\n\nUpdate to version 20261022.00:\n\n- Update go dependencies (#641)\n- Remove stale Go module version overrides in _service file\n- Ship gce-workload-cert-refresh.timer (bsc#1273192)\n- Wait for new account to become visible before adding to groups (#635)\n- Update golang.org/x/crypto to v0.58.0\n- Update golang.org/x/net to v0.61.0\n- Validate username using unicode.IsSpace to reject all Unicode whitespace characters (#637)\n- Update dependencies to latest (#636)\n- fix octal digit comparison in morePermissive (#631)\n- Remove KillMode from google-guest-agent-manager (#629)\n- Fix SUSE Linux Micro 6+ (#628) (bsc#1253357)\n- Exclude irrelevant tests on FreeBSD (#625)\n- Replace abandoned serial dependency (#624)\n- Add build rules for MWLID extension\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "details",
        "text": "SUSE-SLE-Micro-6.0-951",
        "title": "Patchnames"
      },
